    {
      "command": "employee hire role:driller",
      "description": "#553: drill_hole is now a queued, vehicle-gated action -- a driller physically drives a drill_rig to each hole -- so this file (which pre-#553 never needed a driller at all) now needs one. campaign start has no staffed:true equivalent, so this is a manual hire + purchase, same pattern as weather-flood.json/vibration-budget.json. Employee #2 -- #1 is the surveyor hired above.",
